 "notes": [
  "Audit of Loblaws (vendor == Loblaws, 32,098 Hammer product rows) against the 128 catalogue items using the repo's own matcher as baseline (scrapers/match.ts matchProduct, best-score-per-product as import-hammer.ts does). No price data was available; judged from name, brand, units text only.",
  "Baseline matcher accepts 1422 Loblaws products; 281 are kept (assignments), 1141 are excluded. Excluded by cause (my classification, one cause per product): wrong product type (matched on a loose word): 533; wrong variant/flavour/form: 489; wrong pack size: 65; pack size unverifiable (units blank/error/by weight vs bag): 39; organic/plant-based/gluten-free variant: 14; unclear: 1.",
  "Kept = same product type AND same pack size as catalogue (exact within about 1-3%, no organic/plant-based/gluten-free/low-sodium/flavoured/premium-grade variants, not a loose-word match like butter tarts or apple gummies). Counted packs (6/8/10/12 count) were only kept when the count is in the name or units.",
  "Strictness choices that exclude otherwise-plausible products: 946 mL broths vs 900 mL item; 2.84 L oil vs 3 L; 1.8 kg basmati vs 2 kg; 454 g/500 g ricotta vs 475 g; 427 g margarine vs 454 g; organic produce; bagged produce vs per-kg items; lactose-free/PurFiltre/grass-fed/3.8% milks; low-sodium or reduced-fat versions.",
